      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -40,
        -420
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Store factory: page design (Claude Code hand-off)\nStarted by \"Shopify Automation\" when a brief is saved with status `new` (or by hand with a `row_id`).\n\n1. **Page Design**: the run pauses. Claude Code (Harsh's desktop session) reads the request, designs the page with the page builder (plan and copy written by Claude Code, checked by code), shows Harsh, and posts the result with an approval code. Nothing touches the store.\n2. **Write to Draft**: the run pauses again. Only after Harsh says yes to that exact page does Claude Code write it into the client's DRAFT theme (never the live theme) and post the result.\n\nEvery step is recorded on the brief's row in **dtj_client_intake** (page_status, approve_code, approved_by). Source in git: `n8n/store-factory/`.",
        "color": 5,
        "width": 1300,
        "height": 300
      }
    }
